# v34: only the site's own files go to Vercel. Without this every file in the repository was served from the site's
# address: /CLAUDE.md, /docs/HISTORY.md, /api_server.py, /tests/..., where search engines can find them.
# Everything in the root is left out, and each line below lets one thing back in.
# A new file the site needs (an image, a page) has to be added here too.
# NOTE: GitHub's "upload files" button skips files whose name starts with a dot — edit this one in GitHub's editor.
/*
!index.html
!sw.js
!manifest.json
!vercel.json
!robots.txt
!favicon.svg
!favicon-32.png
!apple-touch-icon.png
!icon-192.png
!icon-512.png
!icon-maskable-512.png
!badge-96.png
!logo.png
!og-image.png
!chart.umd.min.js
!api
